            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le registre de sécurité des réponses est indisponible. Aucun nouveau message ne sera envoyé."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The reply safety record is unavailable. Nothing new will be sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reply to %@ needs your explicit request to send. You can also revise it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse à %@ attend une demande explicite de votre part. Vous pouvez aussi la corriger."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The reply to %@ needs your explicit request to send. You can also revise it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved file couldn’t be opened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier enregistré n’a pas pu être ouvert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved file couldn’t be opened."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved file is damaged as a whole, so none of it could be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier enregistré est endommagé dans son ensemble : aucune partie n’a pu être lue."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved file is damaged as a whole, so none of it could be read."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved file was written by a newer version of MORE.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier enregistré a été écrit par une version plus récente de MORE."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved file was written by a newer version of MORE."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved observation changed. Review and approve this moment again before speaking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’observation enregistrée a changé. Relisez et approuvez à nouveau ce moment avant la lecture."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved observation changed. Review and approve this moment again before speaking."
          }
        }
